// Investigation findings are authored in Mermaid (which renders natively on
// GitHub and in docs), but the terminal renderer (glamour) shows a
// ```mermaid block as raw source. This package converts the common
// "producer → input → consumer → retries → cost" chain shape that the
// investigation prompt steers agents toward into a real diagram, while
// deliberately refusing anything more complex (branches, back-edges,
// subgraphs, unrecognized syntax) so callers fall back to the raw Mermaid
// source rather than rendering a misleading partial picture.
//
